{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>HabitMkr 是一款為 iPhone、iPad 與 Mac 而設的私人習慣追蹤工具，適合想建立日常規律、保持持續習慣的人使用。它讓你快速勾選習慣、查看進度與連續紀錄，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，原價 US $0.99。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-138.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>建立規律並追蹤進度</h2>\n<p>你可建立每日、每週或自訂排程的習慣，並用顏色與圖示區分；透過簡單控制快速勾選，亦可加入筆記。主畫面與鎖定畫面小工具讓重要習慣保持可見，進度頁顯示目前與最佳連續紀錄、每週及每月完成格狀圖、漏做日子與完成率。資料會透過 iCloud 在裝置間同步。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-142-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-143-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-144-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-145-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-146-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-147-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：HabitMkr: Habit Tracker</li><li>應用類別：Productivity</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/habitmkr-habit-tracker/id6789409693?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T15:41:51.755510+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":302,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T15:31:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T22:18:35.250393+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T15:38:37.845240+00:00","content_hash":"609049175b777759176ab2979c144937704dcf2dba165d9e446f61f98df41815","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}